---
mm: 1.1
kind: dir
name: tools
option: buildable-target no
read-only: buildable-target
folder: build
folder: configure
folder: debug
folder: flash
folder: test
folder: check
folder: model
folder: json
folder: run
folder: shell
folder: sketch
---

Every tool here executes on the machine running the build, so the whole
directory is buildable-target no, and the lock keeps a tool from opting back in
without that being a visible decision in this manifest.
